name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q8_2025'

question 'A streaming site has a "Next Episode" button that loads the next video in your playlist every time you click it. What happens in the code when that button is pressed?'

right 'The app calls a function that runs the steps to load the next episode.'
wrong 'The app automatically deletes the previous episode from its database.'
wrong 'The app randomly picks a new show for you to watch.'
wrong 'The app changes the website\'s layout colors to match the new episode.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

